[MILESTONE 5] FULL MODEL ASSEMBLY + GLOBAL SHARED GEOMETRIC STRATUM — COMPLETE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- models/feudal_model.py:
  * FeudalModelConfig wraps the per-block FeudalConfig and adds vocab_size,
    num_blocks, stratum_rank; from_json loads nested block geometry.
  * GlobalGeometricStratum: the single learned convergence point ABOVE every
    pyramid. RMSNorm -> (optional low-rank D->r->D) shared basis projection ->
    per-channel gate, added residually. from_stratum weight and stratum_gate
    both init to 0, so the layer is an EXACT identity at init (proven by test,
    atol=0) and only learns to bend the global basis as training proceeds.
  * FeudalBehemoth: embedding -> N FeudalPyramidBlocks (residual stream) ->
    global stratum -> final RMSNorm -> tied lm_head. Sums each block's Switch
    load-balance loss into out["load_balance_loss"]; optional per-block aux.
  * load_minion_fragment(fragment, block_index): re-prefixes a weight-surgery
    fragment to blocks.{i}.* and loads it into a chosen block (strict=False).
- configs/feudal_model_test_small.json: 3-block, vocab-256, rank-16 test geometry.
- models/__init__.py re-exports the new model symbols.

